A||||2||Fiero5||Anyone know any good saleperson jokes?||||12||
Z||000000||Fiero5||04-12-2001||11:12 AM||||A salesman walking along the beach found a bottle. When he rubbed it, lo and behold, a genie appeared.<BR>"I will grant you three wishes," announced the genie. "But I am not a very good genie, for some reason every wish I grant, your rival will get the wish as well -- only<BR>double."<P>The salesman thought about this for a while, and then said that was OK. <BR>"For my first wish, I would like ten million dollars," he announced.<BR>Instantly the genie gave him a Swiss bank account number and assured the man that $10,000,000 had been deposited. "But as I feared, your rival has just received<BR>$20,000,000," the genie said.<P>"I've always wanted a Ferrari," the salesman said.<BR>Instantly a Ferrari appeared. "But alas, your rival has just received two Ferraris," the genie said. "And what is your last wish?"<P>"Well," said the salesman, "I've always wanted to donate a kidney for transplant."||||reg||12
